# THE READ MUST NOT REST ON A DIE. Item::ReadScroll gates the whole effect on
# SkillCheck(SK_DECIPHER, 10 + sLevel) (src/Magic.cpp:6205). Enchant Armour is
# Level 3 and sLevel is Level*2-1, so the DC is 15, and this mage's Decipher
# Script rating is +2. The check script sets INCURSION_RUNTO_SKILL_ROLL=20,
# which forces the d20 of every skill check, so each read totals 22
# (LastSkillCheckResult is rating + roll, src/Skills.cpp:1849): above the DC, and
# not above 20 + sLevel = 25, where the scroll would be preserved on a coin toss
# (src/Magic.cpp:6214). Both reads therefore enchant and both scrolls are spent.
